Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:40:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 57/60] Shaders: a uniform branch can choose between immediate
 samplers

A sampler picked by a branch from two immediate (static) samplers was a
phi of constants, which the translator could not lower: the shader was
not made, and DexNom counts 40 variants of the world's lost that way.
Sample with both and select the texel on the edge that chose the sampler.

The integer-target blend half of the upstream commit is already in
VIctory-RDNA as host_blend.

(cherry picked from DexNom/VIctory ddb73326, in part)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G6tkVHCftUUQbGm5NirGaG
